7. **预测与提交**：对测试集输出 `id, score`。## Step-0  SQL 优化建议（离线处理）
以下示例以 *risk_train* 为基础，从交易类型、余额变动、资金流向、手机银行活跃度等维度提取增量特征，仅展示思路，实际可根据资源约束增删：

```sql
CREATE TABLE enriched_train AS
SELECT 
    t.*,  -- market_* 原始 20 列 + label
    -- 手机银行活跃变化
    (t.f14 + 1.0) / (NULLIF(t.f15,0) + 1)  AS mb_login_1m_vs_3m,
    (t.f14 + 1.0) / (NULLIF(t.f16,0) + 1)  AS mb_login_1m_vs_6m,
    (t.f15 + 1.0) / (NULLIF(t.f16,0) + 1)  AS mb_login_3m_vs_6m,
    -- 资产变化率
    (t.f17 - t.f18) / (NULLIF(t.f18,0)+1) AS deposit_decay_rate,
    (t.f19 - t.f20) / (NULLIF(t.f20,0)+1) AS invest_decay_rate,
    -- 资金流失率（当期月均 vs 历史三月均）
    (t.f17 + t.f19) / (t.f18 + t.f20 + 1) AS asset_shift_ratio,
    -- risk_train 交易衍生特征
    COUNT(r.id)                             AS txn_cnt,
    SUM(r.f11)                              AS txn_amt_total,
    SUM(CASE WHEN r.f4='C' THEN r.f11 END)  AS inflow_amt,
    SUM(CASE WHEN r.f4='D' THEN r.f11 END)  AS outflow_amt,
    SUM(CASE WHEN r.f4='D' THEN r.f11 END)/
        (SUM(CASE WHEN r.f4='C' THEN r.f11 END)+1) AS out_in_ratio,
    -- 最近一笔交易距观测日的天数
    DATEDIFF('2025-04-30', MAX(r.f13))      AS days_since_last_txn,
    -- 渠道多样性
    COUNT(DISTINCT r.f16)                   AS channel_nunique,
    -- 高频交易类型计数
    SUM(CASE WHEN r.f1 IN ('84','85') THEN 1 END)  AS fast_pay_cnt,
    SUM(CASE WHEN r.f1 IN ('8101','6') THEN 1 END) AS transfer_cnt
FROM market_train t
LEFT JOIN risk_train r ON t.id = r.id
GROUP BY ALL;
```
以上示例：
1. 精简了不必要的 *risk_train* 字段，降低宽表宽度；
2. 用 `DATEDIFF` 及 `COUNT(DISTINCT)` 提升行为信息密度；
3. 通过 **资产衰减率**、**手机银行活跃度趋势** 等特征捕捉潜在流失信号。

